Can medium-chain triglycerides (MCT) help with weight loss in obese individuals on a calorie-restricted diet when MCT constitutes 24% of total calories over three months?,"<bos><start_of_turn>user
Can medium-chain triglycerides (MCT) help with weight loss in obese individuals on a calorie-restricted diet when MCT constitutes 24% of total calories over three months?<end_of_turn>
