   The Poynting vector is along the axis of the cable. The magnitude is:
   \[
   S = \frac{I E}{2} = \frac{\xi^2}{2R} \left( \frac{1}{a} - \frac{1}{r} \right)
   \]
   The direction is along the axis of the cable.

