   \binom{12}{9} = \frac{12!}{9! \times 3!} = 12 \times 11 \times 10 / (3 \times 2 \times 1) = 12 \times 11 \times 5 / 3 = 12 \times 11 \times 5 / 3 = 120
   \]  
