\]
Thus, the exponential function is:
\[
f(x) = \sqrt{6} \cdot \left(\left(\frac{1}{6}\right)^{1/4}\right)^x = \sqrt{6} \cdot \left(\frac{1}{6}\right)^{x/4}
\]

