\]
Simplifying, we get:
\[
\nabla \times \mathbf{V} = \boxed{0 \mathbf{i} - \frac{\partial f}{\partial x} \mathbf{j} + \left( \frac{\partial g}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial g}{\partial y} \right) \mathbf{k}} = \boxed{0 \mathbf{i} - \frac{\partial f}{\partial x} \mathbf{j} + \left( \frac{\partial g}{\partial x} - \frac{\partial g}{\partial y} \right) \mathbf{k}}.
\]
